Name: icu4x_data
URL: https://github.com/unicode-org/icu4x
Version: 2.4.0
Revision: 031d9e89f6a3fd26a14491e090729d46094328fd
Update Mechanism: Manual (https://crbug.com/449898466)
License: Unicode-3.0
License File: //third_party/rust/icu4x_data/LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Pre-generated ICU4X baked data macros for Chromium, generated by
//tools/crates/run_icu4x_datagen.py (//tools/crates/icu4x_datagen) from
upstream CLDR (49.0.0), ICU (release-79.1rc), Unicode RSCD (release-79.1rc),
IANA TZDB (2026a), and segmenter LSTM (v0.1.0) source data filtered via
//third_party/icu/filters/*.json.

Local Modifications:
Generated by //tools/crates/run_icu4x_datagen.py (//tools/crates/icu4x_datagen)
with Chromium ICU4X-json patches in //third_party/rust/icu4x_data/patches/
applied. See //third_party/rust/icu4x_data/README.md for regeneration
instructions.
